        1262,
        1791,
        1534
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "To advance this objective, I instruct the Department of Personnel, in cooperation with the Bureau of the Budget, to institute prior to January 1, 1965, a pilot trainee program in selected operating and maintenance work areas in City government and ask the Board of Education to give its assistance in the development and administration of the related and supplemental training required in the program.",
      "logprob_stats": {
